{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":3873038,"ns":0,"title":"Fréchet manifold","extract":"In mathematics, in particular in nonlinear analysis, a Fréchet manifold is a topological space modeled on a Fréchet space in much the same way as a manifold is modeled on a Euclidean space.\nMore precisely, a Fréchet manifold consists of a Hausdorff space \n  \n    \n      \n        X\n      \n    \n    {\\displaystyle X}\n  \n with an atlas of coordinate charts over Fréchet spaces whose transitions are smooth mappings.","description":"Topological space in mathematics","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}